eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"iXPEyHqvaDUWLn4pw-58Fw","review_id":"Gx1y5sDZtt2FazaPfAkiug","date":"2017-07-25T15:43:37","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9193917512893677,"text_excerpt":"We accidentally came here instead of Cafe Envie which is very close and the name is exactly the same. Anyways we had bagel and lox with a potato salad on the side, for breakfast: which was really delicious. I had a hot latte which was really strong, tasty with the latte art which is an ecstatic plus. The ambience is nice and breezy, baristas are friendly (very important!!!) We will come back here again!!"},{"business_id":"iXPEyHqvaDUWLn4pw-58Fw","review_id":"LLTuz4nthzisnZj7AB1aNQ","date":"2019-02-22T22:07:23","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9178972244262695,"text_excerpt":"What a cute little coffee shop in the Quarter! I liked this place because they are one of the few coffee shops in the NOLA area that serve booze in their coffee... I do not understand why that is? Regardless, I am grateful for Envie. There are two of them, one at the beginning of Decatur and one at the end. I have only been to the 300 block one. The service was great and the irish coffee was pretty good. I do wish the irish coffee was a little stronger and had the authentic whipping cream on top and was placed in a clear glass so I could see the layers, but other than that, it was pretty good in taste. I would like to try the other drinks, especially the rum chatta ones. Very interesting!..."},{"business_id":"iXPEyHqvaDUWLn4pw-58Fw","review_id":"HMHl_yX-9oGhJjuuhX-jbQ","date":"2017-07-25T15:41:10","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9142804741859436,"text_excerpt":"We came here for breakfast to try a different local place. I had the bagel & lox and it was delicious! It was one of the best i had. Their lattes are also amazing, nothing like a Starbucks or a coffee chain latte. The staff was very friendly. If you are in NOLA definitely check this place out for a nice local breakfast."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"iXPEyHqvaDUWLn4pw-58Fw","photo_id":"jw1cNwIZ9rA3HJLRtPYjZA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/jw1cNwIZ9rA3HJLRtPYjZA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8869966864585876},{"business_id":"iXPEyHqvaDUWLn4pw-58Fw","photo_id":"266mCRfyiCP6LiAJNCmXJA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/266mCRfyiCP6LiAJNCmXJA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8445243835449219},{"business_id":"iXPEyHqvaDUWLn4pw-58Fw","photo_id":"yascY1p8G-Iakd1Ht7CG2A","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/yascY1p8G-Iakd1Ht7CG2A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8374640941619873},{"business_id":"iXPEyHqvaDUWLn4pw-58Fw","photo_id":"2OgluzjHXHOx0wagRTXFmw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/2OgluzjHXHOx0wagRTXFmw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.83576899766922},{"business_id":"iXPEyHqvaDUWLn4pw-58Fw","photo_id":"GSIzmNUF-JaclFlK-YwDoA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/GSIzmNUF-JaclFlK-YwDoA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.795193076133728}]},"notebook_case":null}
